## Standard Response Contracts

### Success List Response (Paginated)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
    "title": "Jatuh Suka",
    "slug": "jatuh-suka",
    "artist_id": "art_3d8e1f",
    "album_id": "alb_9c4b2a",
    "duration": 224,
    "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_7f9a2b1c/playlist.m3u8",
    "album": {
      "title": "Manusia"
    },
    "artists": [
      {
        "id": "art_3d8e1f",
        "name": "Tulus"
      }
    ],
    "images": {
      "small": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_small.webp",
      "medium": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_medium.webp",
      "large": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_large.webp",
      "original": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/trk_7f9a2b1c_original.webp"
    }
  }
]
```

### Count Endpoint Response

```json
{
  "total": 1450
}
```

### Error Responses

#### `401 Unauthorized`
```json
{
  "error": "E_AUTH",
  "message": "Invalid or missing API key"
}
```

#### `404 Not Found`
```json
{
  "error": "E_NOT_FOUND",
  "message": "The requested resource could not be found"
}
```

#### `503 Service Unavailable (Maintenance)`
```json
{
  "maintenance": true,
  "description": "Lament API is currently under maintenance for system upgrades.",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-30T08:00:00Z"
}
```

---

## Status Codes

| Code | Status | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `200` | OK | Success |
| `201` | Created | Resource successfully created |
| `304` | Not Modified | ETag matched; cached client response is valid |
| `400` | Bad Request | Invalid query parameters or body payload |
| `401` | Unauthorized | Missing or invalid `x-api-key` / `X-Master-Key` |
| `404` | Not Found | Target ID or route does not exist |
| `500` | Internal Error | Unhandled edge worker error |
| `503` | Maintenance | API maintenance flag is active |
